hadiths[20]{hadithnumber,text}:
"4408","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay jwtay myn dw thpray thay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4409","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw apnay ayk ghzwh myn yh frmatay hwyay sna kh jwtay phnnay ka mamwl bnalyn، kywnkh aadmy jb tk syndl phnta hay swary krta rhta hay۔ (mtlb yh hay kh syndl phnnay say hrkt myn aasany hwty hay awr paon ky skhty ya srk kay kantwn say hfazt hwty hay۔ as lyay yhan as ka mwaznh janwr pr swar hwnay say kya gya hay۔) mslm nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4410","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say kwyy jwtay phnay tw phlay dahnay kw phnayay awr jb ataray tw phlay bayyn kw ataray، takh dayyn wala sb say phlay phna jayay awr sb say aakhr myn atara jayay“ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4411","as nay khda kay rswl ka byan krtay hwyay kha، \tm myn say kwyy ayk jwtay kay sath nh chlna chahyay، blkh nngay paon chlna chahyay ya jwra phnna chahyay۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""
"4412","jabr rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb aadmy ky jwty ka tkra kat dya jayay tw wh ayk jwtay kay sath nh chlay jb tk kh wh apny chwt kw thyk nh kr lay، wh ayk jwtay kay sath nh chlay، nh bayyn hath say khana khayay، ya ghtnwn kay grd ayk kpra lpyt kr bythnay pr shara nh lay، ya apnay bazw kw mkml twr pr lpyt kr nh khwlay“۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4413","abn abas rzy allh anhma nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky jwty kay dw thylay thay، an kay ptay dwgna thay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4414","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mna frmaya kh aadmy khray hw kr jwtay phnay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4415","asay trmzy awr abn majh nay abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt kya hay۔"
"4416","alqasm b۔ mhmd nay aayshh rzy allh anha ka hwalh dytay hwyay kha kh nby sly allh alyh wslm aksr ayk syndl phn kr chltay thay۔ ayk wrzhn khta hay kh wh ayk syndl phn kr chlty thy۔ trmzy nay asay nql kya hay awr kha hay kh yh shyh hay۔"
"4417","abn abas nay kha kh yh snt ka hsh hay kh jb aadmy byth jayay tw wh apnay jwtay atar kr apnay phlw myn rkhay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4418","abn brydh nay apnay wald ky snd say byan kya kh njashy nay nby sly allh alyh wslm kw dw sadh syah jwtay pysh kyay awr aap nay anhyn phna dya۔ abn majh nay asay nql kya hay awr trmzy nay abn brydh ky snd myn apnay wald ky snd say yh azafh kya hay kh as kay bad anhwn nay wzw kya awr an pr msh kya۔"
"4419","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh wh hyz kay wqt rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sr myn knghy krty thyn۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4420","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qdym nbwy snt (arby lfz ftrh hay۔ as ka bnyady many hay tkhlyq ka tryqh۔ yh dyn aslam kay lyay bhy astamal hwta hay، lykn as rwayt myn as ka many snt kha gya hay js ky pyrwy pranay anbyaa kram nay ky hay، as lyay as ka trjmh awpr kya gya hay) as wzaht kay sath panch khswsytyn hyn۔ astra، mwnchhyn trashna، nakhn katna، awr bghl kay nychay bal akharna۔\ (bkhary w mslm)"""
"4421","abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mshrk jw kchh krtay hyn as kay braks krw، darhy lmby krw awr mwnchhyn trashw“۔ ayk wrzhn hay، \mwnchhyn kat dw awr darhy chhwr dw۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""
"4422","ans nay kha kh an say kha gya tha kh wh mwnchhyn trashnay، nakhn trashnay، bghlwn kay nychay say bal akhrnay awr naf mndwanay kay drmyan chalys dn say zyadh nh gzryn۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4423","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yhwd w nsaryٰ [apny darhywn kw] khzab nhyn lgatay، lhza an say mkhtlf slwk krw۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4424","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh fth mkh kay dn jb abw qhafh (abwbkr rzy allh anh kay wald) kw laya gya tw an ka sr awr darhy zayfh ky trh sfyd thy، tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: asay ksy chyz say bdl dw، lykn kalay rng say bchw۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4425","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh nby sly allh alyh wslm an amwr myn ahl ktab ky trh krna psnd krtay thay jn ka aap kw kwyy hkm nhyn mla tha۔ ahl ktab apnay balwn kw jhkatay thay awr mshrk apnay balwn kw alg krtay thay، tw nby sly allh alyh wslm nay apny pyshany ka bal jhka dya، lykn bad myn aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn alg kr dya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4426","nafa nay abn amr say nql kya hay kh anhwn nay nby sly allh alyh wslm kw qza say mna krtay hwyay sna hay۔ nafa say pwchha gya kh qza kya hay tw as nay jwab dya kh as myn lrkay kay sr ka kchh hsh bnjr hw kr mndwaya hwa hay۔ (bkhary w mslm) baz nay as ky wzaht kw rwayt ka hsh bnaya۔"
"4427","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk lrkay kw dykha kh as kay sr ka kchh hsh mndwaya hwa hay awr kchh hsh bghyr mwnd dya gya hay، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn aysa krnay say mna frmaya، awr frmaya: ”asay mwnd dw ya sb chhwr dw۔“ mslm nay rwayt ky۔"
